      "content": "i don't know. it feels less like i'm waiting and more like i'm just... stuck. everything is so much work now. even just getting through the day feels like i'm fighting against myself. sometimes i think i've already finished my part, and now i'm just lingering. it doesn't feel right to keep dragging this out.",
